flowchart LR
  Dev[Developer laptop] -->|git push| GH[(GitHub repo)]
  GH -->|webhook| GHA[GitHub Actions CI]
  GH -->|Git integration| VB[Vercel Build]
  VB --> Edge[Vercel Edge Network / CDN<br/>static HTML, JS, fonts, images]
  VB --> Fn[Vercel Function<br/>contact handler]
  User[Visitor browser] -->|HTTPS| DNS[DNS: custom domain]
  DNS --> Edge
  User -->|POST| Fn
  User -->|widget| CF[Cloudflare Turnstile]
  Fn -->|siteverify| CF
  Fn -->|API key| RS[Resend]
  RS -->|SMTP, SPF/DKIM| Inbox[Owner inbox]
  Edge -.-> Analytics[Vercel Analytics / Speed Insights]
